---

This package's data layout (SOUL.md / MEMORY.md / BOOTSTRAP.md / index.md /
log.md and the category directories) and the overall design follow
dsh-plugin-memory by LittleBlackTong (MIT):
https://github.com/LittleBlackTong/dsh-plugin-memory

The implementation here is a rewrite: the boot injection layer, house rules
with their own budget, compaction-loss checking, mood, tidy reminder, harvest,
auto-index and the self-wake mechanism are all new code. No file from that
project is copied verbatim beyond the on-disk conventions it established.
